# Extra untracked commonrc
# Copy into commonrc-pre, and it will be sourced by commonrc at the very beginning 
# NOTE: rerun make so that it gets linked to $HOME.

# Useful for things that could be conditional to machine and that need to run ahead, for
# instance due to something in commonrc depending on it.

# For example:
# custom ssh-agent identity lifetime (see scripts/sagent).
# export SSH_AGENT_TTL=....
